[Open-Meteo Data Directory]

This directory stores hourly weather grid data files.

Structure:
- manifest.json: Index of available hourly windows and variables
- streaming/: Subdirectory containing hourly grid files
  - YYYY-MM-DDTHH.json: Hourly grid data (one file per hour)

Generated by: streaming/ingest.py
Updated: Daily at 11 AM IST via GitHub Actions
